// ==============================================================================
// VerySync (微力同步) 过滤规则 - rime-moqi-wanxiang-schemas
// 策略: 保护双端 Rime 配置与核心词典；隔离 Weasel 单机二进制/LevelDB；过滤临时与独占状态
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. 小狼毫（Weasel）单机运行态与编译二进制（极高危：防 LevelDB 坏库与机器 ID 覆盖）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)build
(?d)*.userdb
(?d)*.userdb.*
(?d)installation.yaml
(?d)user.yaml
// 说明：保留 /sync 目录，通过小狼毫自带的「用户资料同步」安全合并双端词频

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. 评测缓存、临时/大体积词典与语言模型
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)node_modules
(?d)cache
(?d)trash
(?d)cn_dicts_temp
(?d)cn_dicts_dazhu
(?d)cn_dicts_sancang
(?d)cn_dicts_xh_cangjie
(?d)sancang.dict.yaml
(?d)*.gram
(?d)*.bin
(?d).worktrees
(?d)*.zip

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. Python 运行环境与脚本检查缓存
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.py[cod]
(?d)*.nbc
(?d)*.nbi
(?d).ruff_cache
(?d).pytest_cache
(?d).mypy_cache
(?d).venv
(?d)venv

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4. Git 仓库安全保护（排除锁与瞬态工作态）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/*.lock
**/.git/index.lock
**/.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
**/.git/TAG_EDITMSG
**/.git/FETCH_HEAD
**/.git/ORIG_HEAD
**/.git/rebase-apply
**/.git/rebase-merge
.git/*.lock
.git/index.lock
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 5. 通用现代编辑器单机状态与本地临时文件隔离
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Sublime Text
(?d)*.sublime-workspace

// 2. VS Code / Cursor / Zed / Helix / JetBrains / Visual Studio
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d).vscode/ipch
(?d).vscode/.browse.*
(?d).vscode/*.log
(?d).cursor/cache
(?d).cursor/state
(?d).zed/settings.local.json
(?d).helix/*.local.toml
(?d).helix/*.log
(?d).idea
(?d)*.suo
(?d)*.user
(?d)*.userosv
(?d)*.sln.docstates

// 3. Vim / 交换文件 / 临时文本 / Office 锁 / 同步工具临时标记
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d).netrwhist
(?d)~$*
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.bak
(?d)*.log
(?d)sync.ffs_db
(?d)*.ffs_db
(?d)*.sync-conflict*
